    {
      "id": "2120376028816367714",
      "text": "Monty on Dvorsky: \"He's a good hockey player. We've seen it. There's a reason why we believe he's a huge part of our future. Because he's an outstanding young man, great to coach and wants to be a hockey player. It'll come. Sometimes it doesnt happen as quickly as we want it to.\"",
      "url": "https://x.com/jprutherford/status/2120376028816367714",
      "published": "2026-11-11T04:40:14+00:00",
      "likes": 62,
      "author": "Jeremy Rutherford",
      "handle": "jprutherford",
