      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2120373908541243507",
      "text": "Barron: 3G, 10 pts in 15 gms Monty: \"He's done it long enough to think this is the best version of him. He wasn't a 1st rd pick by mistake. It's clear by his talent. He's putting it all together and it's awesome watching someone blossom like that. Great job by our pro scouts.\"",
      "url": "https://x.com/jprutherford/status/2120373908541243507",
